0 0x7b21 [0x88]: PERF_RECORD_MMAP2 200/200: [0x7e00003000(0x1000) @ 0x1000 08:01 1 0]: r-xp /path/to/page-pie.bin
0 0x7b22 [0x88]: PERF_RECORD_MMAP2 200/200: [0x7e00004000(0x1000) @ 0x1000 08:01 1 0]: rw-p /path/to/page-pie.bin
