## PID 99 never mapped this binary. Its sample is not a preferred VA and must
## not suppress known-cold for the process that did map it.
0 0x20 [0x30]: PERF_RECORD_SAMPLE(IP, 0x4002): 99/99: 0x7f00001000 period: 1000 addr: 0x7fffffffe000
## A PIE or DSO preferred VA is not a runtime address without a mapping.
0 0x30 [0x30]: PERF_RECORD_SAMPLE(IP, 0x4002): 99/99: 0x7f00001000 period: 1000 addr: 0x3000

