#--- dso-unload.perf
0 0x7b10 [0x88]: PERF_RECORD_MMAP2 100/100: [0x7f01001000(0x1000) @ 0x1000 08:01 1 0]: r-xp /path/to/dso.so
0 0x7b20 [0x88]: PERF_RECORD_MMAP2 100/100: [0x7f01003000(0x1000) @ 0x2000 08:01 1 0]: rw-p /path/to/dso.so
0 0x7b30 [0x88]: PERF_RECORD_MMAP2 100/100: [0x7f01003000(0x1000) @ 0 00:00 0 0]: rw-p //anon
0 0x10 [0x30]: PERF_RECORD_SAMPLE(IP, 0x4002): 100/100: 0x7f01001000 period: 1000 addr: 0x7f01003000
## dlclose, then other.so is loaded into the freed range.
